* [[James Gallagher (California politician)|James Gallagher]] (Republican), incumbent U.S. representative, former [[List of minority leaders of the California State Assembly|Minority Leader of the California Assembly]] (2022–2025) from the [[California's 3rd State Assembly district|3rd district]] (2014–2026)<ref name="Primary 2026">{{#invoke:cite|web|title=Candidates for June 2, 2026, Primary Election |url=https://elections.cdn.sos.ca.gov/statewide-elections/2026-primary/congress.pdf |access-date=March 21, 2026 |publisher=State of California Secretary of State}}</ref>
